WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.076
The verdict is nuanced: Graph Edit Networks are
reproducible,

00:00:04.156 --> 00:00:07.346
elegant and interpretable, and most claims hold.

00:00:07.426 --> 00:00:11.774
But one scaling claim is wrong, backward passes are
super-linear,

00:00:11.854 --> 00:00:18.110
and several benchmarks reward memorising seen
transitions rather than genuine generalisation.
